'''Elling Trias''' is the owner of the shop [[Trias' Cheese]], which is located in the [[Trade District]] within [[Stormwind City]]. He runs the shop with [[Elaine Trias|Elaine]] and [[Ben Trias]], his wife and son. Giving the impression of being a mere cheesemaker, Elling Trias is a man with more to him than it appears at first glance. He has an extensive web of contacts, stretching from [[SI:7]] to [[Kirsta Deepshadow|agents]] as far off as [[Hearthglen]].<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|58|Unfinished Business (3)|Unfinished Business}}</ref>

[[Tyrion]] is his old friend.<ref>{{Alliance}} [31] [[Infiltrating the Castle]]</ref> He also has some kind of a history with [[Jorgen]],<ref name="The Missing Diplomat (4)">{{questlong|Alliance|28|The Missing Diplomat (4)|The Missing Diplomat}}</ref> is one of [[Bishop DeLavey]]'s contacts,<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|28|The Missing Diplomat (2)|The Missing Diplomat}}</ref><ref>{{questlong|Alliance|30|The Missing Diplomat (6)|The Missing Diplomat}}</ref> had history in Stormwind with [[Mikhail]],<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|33|The Missing Diplomat (11)|The Missing Diplomat}}</ref> knew [[Watcher Backus]] of [[Darkshire]]<ref name="The Missing Diplomat (4)"/> and [[Commander Samaul]] of the [[Theramore Guard]],<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|35|The Missing Diplomat (14)|The Missing Diplomat}}</ref> and works with adventurers to uncover [[Defias Brotherhood]] activity in kidnapping a "[[Varian Wrynn|diplomat]]" at [[Theramore Isle]].

